shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-06T02:23:39.3161921Z           "Not ready to decide? Defer it to a date and time. It comes back to Needs decision then, with a note in your Inbox, or sooner if new evidence arrives.",
