shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-06T02:23:39.3168454Z           "Health with a reason: the exact issue putting a project at risk.",
shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-06T02:23:39.3169013Z           "When a cycle ends, unfinished work rolls into the next one.",
shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-06T02:23:39.3169578Z           "Every change and decision is kept, with who made it and when.",
